  description: "Listening Piano Keys 1.1\nForgot to look at the music? Guess you'll
    have to play it by ear.\r\n\r\nPlay a familiar melody by ear.\r\n\r\nModule ID:
    listeningPiano\r\n\r\nCode overhaul by Timwi\nPiano Keys assets by Bashly\r\nListening
    assets by Perky\r\nOriginal code by MykiiVT\r\n\r\nManual available here: https://ktane.timwi.de/HTML/Listening%20Piano%20Keys.html\r\n\r\nPlease
    let me know about any bugs on discord at mykiivt :)\r\n\r\nSupports:\r\n- TP\r\n-
    LFA\r\n---\r\nBuild 1.0 notes:\r\n- Initial release\n\nBuild 1.1 notes:\n- Now
    easier and more cohesive to add new songs(Thanks Timwi!)\n- Added ~60 new songs
    with the help of Timwi, thunder and other fellow community members\n- *Removed*
    Souvenir support(Solo module)\n- Removed Victory Jingle because it was incorrect,
    and the correct tune doesn't sit nicely within the range"
